      "stem": "In the photoelectric effect, the kinetic energy of the emitted electrons depends on",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "a",
          "text": "the intensity of the light"
        },
        {
          "id": "b",
          "text": "the frequency of the light"
        },
        {
